  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Gong Wan Ting hesitates over sending a nameless junior against Xue Wu Hen, Ye Lui tribe’s Gu Immortal Ye Lui Hui Hong smiles and says the junior might only be rank six, but is talented in fighting and often pulls brilliant moves in battle, and that even the tribe’s first supreme elder has praised him repeatedly. Gong Wan Ting finds it not good to contradict him publicly and agrees.",
      "chapters": [
        1194
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gong_wan_ting",
        "char_xue_wu_hen",
        "fac_ye_lui_tribe",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Xue Wu Hen’s string of wins he consoles Ye Lui Xiao Jin not to take the loss to heart, saying it is not Xiao Jin’s fault but the opponent being too strong after Liu Hui’s death. Seeing Xiao Jin silent with a frozen arm, he sighs inwardly that youth and shame can drive harder effort, and that confidence must not be lost.",
      "chapters": [
        1195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "consoling-xiao-jin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_lui_xiao_jin",
        "char_liu_hui"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Golden Dawn Hall he laughs that even if Liu Guan Yi is stronger, at most he would have rank seven peak battle strength, while their side is a gathering of experts and geniuses.",
      "chapters": [
        1202
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dismissing-liu-guan-yi",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_golden_dawn_hall"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He stands stably during Ye Lui Qun Xing’s fight, understands Qun Xing’s trump cards better than Xiao Jin, and begins to smile while sipping wine when Liu Guan Yi hesitates. He strokes his beard as the smile brightens, yet still reminds Ye Lui Qun Xing to be careful of dragon breath, naming the ancient sword dragon’s strongest weapon and noting it has not been used yet.",
      "chapters": [
        1204
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "warning-about-dragon-breath",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ye_lui_qun_xing"
      ]
    }
  ],
